# Folder library

Canonical: [`.cursor/saved/folder-library/BRIEF.md`](../saved/folder-library/BRIEF.md)  
Format badges: [`.cursor/saved/folder-library/FileCard.original.tsx`](../saved/folder-library/FileCard.original.tsx)

## Product

- **`[+]` menu:** Skills/PDF · Image · Video (not blind create into current tab).
- **Tabs:** All · Images · Videos · AI skills.
- **Image:** tag + TXT-Placeholder + WebP; detail switch + copy + download; **wallColor** on preview pane.
- **Video:** tag + TXT-Placeholder + mp4/webm/mov ≤2 min · ≤100 MB; detail switch + play + download; same **wallColor**.
- **Skill:** tag + “qué hace?” + attachment; open → Download.
- Bytes → `doc-images`. Metadatos → `campaigns.library_items`.

